[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12841.95, "timestamp": "03:34:01", "text": "轻松的追随者。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12844.429, "timestamp": "03:34:04", "text": "去。我的意思是，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12847.83, "timestamp": "03:34:07", "text": "仔细想想，这很难……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12850.91, "timestamp": "03:34:10", "text": "仅凭这些就能支付你的房租和其他开销"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12853.269, "timestamp": "03:34:13", "text": "流媒体。如果你是新手，或者如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12855.11, "timestamp": "03:34:15", "text": "你更像是一个中等规模的主播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12857.75, "timestamp": "03:34:17", "text": "反正也行不通。你必须超级"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12859.469, "timestamp": "03:34:19", "text": "疯狂地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12865.87, "timestamp": "03:34:25", "text": "至少能够做到这一点是受欢迎的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12868.71, "timestamp": "03:34:28", "text": "呃，能够付清房租，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12872.59, "timestamp": "03:34:32", "text": "房租太贵了，难以偿还。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12883.67, "timestamp": "03:34:43", "text": "给她服药后，我会让她出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12889.76, "timestamp": "03:34:49", "text": "你怎么能这样？让她出去玩吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12892.59, "timestamp": "03:34:52", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12896.67, "timestamp": "03:34:56", "text": "少量。我为什么会点击它？"}]